VIEWMODEL.md §3.2, G6: an item a variant view does not take (a group, a show line) is E1627 (variant); its case labels, columns, filters, search and menu are fine.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local variant Reward {
  gold { amount: Int }
  gem { carats: Int }
}

view Reward {
  title "{self.kind}"
  gold "Gold"
  columns { amount }
  group main "Main" { gold }
  show "Kind" "{self.kind}"
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1627]  a/a.canon:12:3
  group is not allowed in the view of this variant

error[E1627]  a/a.canon:13:3
  show is not allowed in the view of this variant

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
